     "t": "p",
     "html": "Skin sensitivity is a common condition that is presented with burning, itching, and/or tight, red skin. Individuals with sensitive skin can have greater reactions to a variety of services and products. Common reasons for skin sensitivity are damage to the skin barrier, medications, environmental causes, rosacea, and more. To help target this skin concern, the following services and products might be right for you."
